        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Dummy Pull Handle for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Dummy Handle Pull (Entry by pull only when device is dogged) for all Wide, Medium, and Narrow Stile Doors (aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Will not cover standard 2-1/8\" bore hole prep. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-rim-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300r\"><b>6300 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300v\"><b>6300 Series Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/narrow-stile-surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-pdq-6400v\"><b>6300 Series Narrow Stile Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware and instructions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of PDQ 6-T-02 Dummy Pull Handle \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dummy Function (ANSI F02) - Entry by pull only when device is dogged.</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 14-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6-t-temp.pdf?v=1718159615\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 6-T Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6W6N6T-Installation.pdf?v=1718159616\" target=\"new\"><b>Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in your choice of Satin Stainless Steel, Dark Bronze, or Matte Black.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Panic Device Dummy Pull Handle, PDQ 6-T-02",
                "description": "PDQ 6-T-02 Dummy Handle Pull (Entry by pull only when device is dogged) For use with PDQ 6300 Touch Bar Rim Exit Devices, PDQ 6300 Vertical Rod Exit Device and other manufactures Panic Devices. Available in Satin Stainless Steel, Dark Bronze, or Matte Black finish. Packaged with rim lock cylinder, mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.",
